  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "刚到济南，便听说杨今甫先生与沈从文先生们由北平来到此处；这是在八月中旬。",
      "output_sha256": "0c73346a09c05b39b5a9b5704e39291e75375440295b4fc9329633deed2d5de0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "0c73346a09c05b39b5a9b5704e39291e75375440295b4fc9329633deed2d5de0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们大概是没停住脚，便往南去了，所以没能见面；他们在路上所受的委屈也就无从知道。",
      "output_sha256": "bbdbbea5f7291c157f0854629255a923e490aa38369a150a87251b34461ca2f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "bbdbbea5f7291c157f0854629255a923e490aa38369a150a87251b34461ca2f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "紧接着，老向也到了。",
      "output_sha256": "bb564d71a4e976746b0dac089d0a4a2dd82929e3203b7c01ea355d5b653c111d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.65,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9218888135e8f39f92de122d0e0ed7019853dbb4312721d8995aa818e7a2003a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bb564d71a4e976746b0dac089d0a4a2dd82929e3203b7c01ea355d5b653c111d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们聊了一个多小时，但要谈的话题实在太多，没能有条理地进行。",
      "output_sha256": "4c6f596a9546664402788c231461566f9a4c7a087e785b5e57a971e0e2ffb578",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.407351,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "08b4948ec8d56ad53cbc495ee1b2f668b26551837a9b41a1202c6f84a38f544c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4c6f596a9546664402788c231461566f9a4c7a087e785b5e57a971e0e2ffb578",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "当天，他便到济南城外去工作，我所要探问的事便无从得到回答——我忙，他也忙，隔着十几里路便很不易相见。",
      "output_sha256": "075f732c631e526542d1ffe37d01a4bbcb8d328f107c411a47eccce07230024e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "075f732c631e526542d1ffe37d01a4bbcb8d328f107c411a47eccce07230024e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "况且空袭的警报，不知哪一会儿响叫起来，若走在半路上便须找地方去等候几十分钟，也太不方便。",
      "output_sha256": "91ccc83c881c6ca200cd4243319719c92b902ccf7e771bf959c0aec16e8629f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "91ccc83c881c6ca200cd4243319719c92b902ccf7e771bf959c0aec16e8629f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "不过，从那天所听到的情况来看，我明白许多朋友依然无法逃离。",
      "output_sha256": "2235fedfdecdf5448923b3fd64bbeec0121d3b5a815e8daeba9d76483910c182",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.502237,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "260600c8f55efaa4821e35dba819d8e85efc6bd1634977b127f0dcd46e0795cd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2235fedfdecdf5448923b3fd64bbeec0121d3b5a815e8daeba9d76483910c182",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们不是不愿动，而是不能动。",
      "output_sha256": "a3e4edde0b65dd3e03da590e7fad8a32f993f41f307979ee9edaf6c59a6e9d09",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "a3e4edde0b65dd3e03da590e7fad8a32f993f41f307979ee9edaf6c59a6e9d09",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有家眷的，未必有积蓄；即使有一点钱，设若全花费在搬动上，逃到了目的地以后，饭食怎办呢？",
      "output_sha256": "b2f8198dbf021a641c660f97e1b53386d8ae1430d966cabee38a6e82f808dc85",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "b2f8198dbf021a641c660f97e1b53386d8ae1430d966cabee38a6e82f808dc85",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "莫若不动。",
      "output_sha256": "2d4127674ef92f1c7e99eabf02b07fa1e68eed2e5dae413f69de81a7f2337a38",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "2d4127674ef92f1c7e99eabf02b07fa1e68eed2e5dae413f69de81a7f2337a38",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "若不动，收入已经断绝，物价又飞涨，能撑多久呢？",
      "output_sha256": "b4b80c2f50d459fdd21dc048ca737153f15511866315ff69c3f52d4991d00840",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.672265,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9eed47322d6f933d54fd9d40e0aae8cf9e3c3f63138e72e495fb75bb9439e7e6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b4b80c2f50d459fdd21dc048ca737153f15511866315ff69c3f52d4991d00840",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "又是问题。",
      "output_sha256": "7abe38a39708eee7f4522d7dfc66ad526df44a7ea2504d2bb38c322464c69b0a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "7abe38a39708eee7f4522d7dfc66ad526df44a7ea2504d2bb38c322464c69b0a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "每个人都有自己的价值和能力，他们心里明白如此停滞对自己既不利，也无助。",
      "output_sha256": "69303c73239ab1a1dff4da4f4b6aa0b62fdea1fa41729b552123b2ad7802696f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.451307,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bd127202a6936ee84e1def0171545acd8641ff221f1ae5e5bdf0e69b5597635a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "69303c73239ab1a1dff4da4f4b6aa0b62fdea1fa41729b552123b2ad7802696f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是弃家独逃于心不安，而外间情形如何又无由晓得，于是由顾虑而迟疑，便无可如何的且等一下再说。",
      "output_sha256": "d3a6ee4ed5aae6fc4ae8b282838d251ddb3c842c2ba26e61ef2c02606ebc1883",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "d3a6ee4ed5aae6fc4ae8b282838d251ddb3c842c2ba26e61ef2c02606ebc1883",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "可见缺乏组织和联系是多么致命的。",
      "output_sha256": "542c7be970138e3ce94a4066f9660f652d3a3d1e067268544ea2a604041b3460",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.271786,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c776b6b7c1346d436def1218324e23d5811a7b92de3b4f2f44a1e6a90892f7db"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "542c7be970138e3ce94a4066f9660f652d3a3d1e067268544ea2a604041b3460",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在这种无组织的情形下，大家可是非常的镇定；知识阶级如是，一般民众也都如是。",
      "output_sha256": "7c809c87317ca3cdc96ea2dfd7c73f0dc3c1ed3319d53887eb422f53f39ba194",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "7c809c87317ca3cdc96ea2dfd7c73f0dc3c1ed3319d53887eb422f53f39ba194",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们都喜听炮声，希望听见炮声，因为郊外一有炮声，必定是我军反攻，使他们兴奋狂喜。",
      "output_sha256": "14fd3b3eb00f8c90ce955c561ae64ad3efdaab49f5609fccb6cf78f73a27a5eb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "14fd3b3eb00f8c90ce955c561ae64ad3efdaab49f5609fccb6cf78f73a27a5eb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "敌人能攻破我们的城池，但绝不能攻破我们的心，于此可见。",
      "output_sha256": "e8b47710af414f1da92c567854ea6644aa17d234cedc9fde18291983077dc8f8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "e8b47710af414f1da92c567854ea6644aa17d234cedc9fde18291983077dc8f8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我询问老向关于经过天津那“关”时的经历，他似乎不愿多谈自己的苦楚；他没有被拘留，也没有受拷问，只是黯然一笑，流露出失望的神情——他认为敌人小看了他！",
      "output_sha256": "96cd76023351e60ef3e385631602d78f003a7cb074de89e93179c7b3d1e42865",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.650455,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "87a68cfd316261ccb5a02589e2b5e3cc50d72129b592e2af57351d344c67ba5c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "96cd76023351e60ef3e385631602d78f003a7cb074de89e93179c7b3d1e42865",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "过了几天，北平《实报》社社长管先生逃至此处，拟在济复兴《实报》，约我写稿。",
      "output_sha256": "51c887392b2a73ee08103cd29e295189b27c4461b1c3dbd2ff6d457fff1f146d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "51c887392b2a73ee08103cd29e295189b27c4461b1c3dbd2ff6d457fff1f146d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“逃”这个字用在他身上再恰当不过了，作为新闻界的重要人物，他直接与敌方宪兵发生过冲突。",
      "output_sha256": "2d6404826ea4cebbe9fec70adba40e5d2786a9078b3f1ae1ae88524cac960365",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.602388,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3c3536404df40508669607f7a698127196bb11eec7b792eb29c8d72141a7a1cd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2d6404826ea4cebbe9fec70adba40e5d2786a9078b3f1ae1ae88524cac960365",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他从家中越墙而出，在天津被拘留了十个小时。",
      "output_sha256": "923f87a0af5d6936c1e7d0de8828948e25ce8525e474110cbf061eecc623daab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.569211,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "563e9ecc50347185b6f02dea2c341852e51a8e85e06e25cf6ee80c677c7b31c4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "923f87a0af5d6936c1e7d0de8828948e25ce8525e474110cbf061eecc623daab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我同时遇到一位不认识的人，也是从北平来的。",
      "output_sha256": "b25bdd6cf21348a48c0d26860b05a8b990f216c24df50dd02e8192f54be339af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.852987,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "52ec665ce3168ef0bd0f380512e433d4f397d878a29b6dbce20fa0bbad8af661"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b25bdd6cf21348a48c0d26860b05a8b990f216c24df50dd02e8192f54be339af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他没说什么事实，只指出以往知识阶级的错误，就是读书人不明军事，而轻易喊一致抗战与抗战到底，以致军队未及充分调整，而敌人已先发制人。",
      "output_sha256": "fc6df89e184551d4118070b35b20ccbf6c98fc96603f58c39004d0eef0d0a44c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "fc6df89e184551d4118070b35b20ccbf6c98fc96603f58c39004d0eef0d0a44c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这个论调，我以为，不十分正确。",
      "output_sha256": "a54b18325813a264fada2388e7af61a339a0ac7bee5ea6f94849ae2755597e03",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "a54b18325813a264fada2388e7af61a339a0ac7bee5ea6f94849ae2755597e03",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不错，知识阶级的好唱高调不能不算是个毛病，可是以敌人的处心积虑侵灭我国，和他们的精密的侦探工作，恐怕并不因为我们的呼声高低而决定发兵与否吧？",
      "output_sha256": "8d7652f4e55281cf03cabd084aad5279ea9c2967e53891bed6f63e360b4dcfc0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d7652f4e55281cf03cabd084aad5279ea9c2967e53891bed6f63e360b4dcfc0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "敌国内部的矛盾与军阀的野心促使他们必来侵伐，而且早动手必定有便宜。",
      "output_sha256": "735230a3a95a55f8e8bac8008babc22295ff0c993e32e1fd5a71651020bfb45a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "735230a3a95a55f8e8bac8008babc22295ff0c993e32e1fd5a71651020bfb45a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "再说，我们的呼喊也不是全无作用：舆论自有它的力量，我们的呼号正足以在敌人必来的时候给执政者与人民一些鼓励，使全国有应战的决心；反正敌人必来，难道我们连口还不开一开么？",
      "output_sha256": "2e1b9aa85ed0266612a24e7da81337036cd649b931edf2aba455203cc39741ca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "2e1b9aa85ed0266612a24e7da81337036cd649b931edf2aba455203cc39741ca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "开口容易，以身作则的去实践却是难事，这倒是知识阶级所应自警自励的。",
      "output_sha256": "f7cfd5132fa633e94e559da1dc2667c3a2978fdf466927b90c29b474ba69823d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "f7cfd5132fa633e94e559da1dc2667c3a2978fdf466927b90c29b474ba69823d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "反之，战事已发，听到一些不好的消息，而灰心而后悔，是与奸商和富翁之主张平和同调矣。",
      "output_sha256": "eb9eacaff18c7ab4f4c29ffdb6bcfa4d6289397392a667c5cb5e2a1f64561c8c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "eb9eacaff18c7ab4f4c29ffdb6bcfa4d6289397392a667c5cb5e2a1f64561c8c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "本月初，周君来，得到很多消息。",
      "output_sha256": "a5833900542185bc4cb5efeeb44416a1ee62363a05c90638375745ce166e5c3a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "a5833900542185bc4cb5efeeb44416a1ee62363a05c90638375745ce166e5c3a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "关于北平，他说尚无恐怖，只是恐慌。",
      "output_sha256": "39524f19b49c1c3ccdd18cb8e479b98837e4c402b7c73722927223d8cbd7c0b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "39524f19b49c1c3ccdd18cb8e479b98837e4c402b7c73722927223d8cbd7c0b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "中小学教师中，已经有人断粮，苦民的处境可想而知。",
      "output_sha256": "b02cc0174aa861c00b63abbfe6ed968904fee01dbe0dfb8542439864d7ac19ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.532202,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "93c9fc9448626f26d93730572416199d329caa7e8063d889e2b34ab6f573223b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b02cc0174aa861c00b63abbfe6ed968904fee01dbe0dfb8542439864d7ac19ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这样下去，谁也不能不揪着一把心。",
      "output_sha256": "b39652ee1e0ff663ad55d10ccb3d30e9225ac751203899309c8f5952ea2f07ca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "b39652ee1e0ff663ad55d10ccb3d30e9225ac751203899309c8f5952ea2f07ca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们因这一揪心而烦恼，敌人却毫无办法，城内则寝食不安，一出城门便有暗箭等着要他们的命。",
      "output_sha256": "c7535a39bbbbeaa6b2d7d94ede806b24051e06a4893e38a620bc351c28076912",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.76477,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d24beddc4770b6079fe9a556040d7eb476a6729526ee3640b9e90c4f7d0b684e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c7535a39bbbbeaa6b2d7d94ede806b24051e06a4893e38a620bc351c28076912",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "吃过了所不能消化的必患胃病，敌人的胜利也便是敌人的愚蠢，他们已经消化不良了。",
      "output_sha256": "2e1c2ef36bd4123bc0561e2adbbc717ed40fd304a2bd1463ecd9f8c1c7688531",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "2e1c2ef36bd4123bc0561e2adbbc717ed40fd304a2bd1463ecd9f8c1c7688531",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "今日我们的失败可转而为我们的胜利，而敌人今日的胜利却是猫咬尿泡而已。",
      "output_sha256": "2e11187f52a168feb3f9b0b64a78603d7e42d0872af5fa8cf5663f1c12d1dd18",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "2e11187f52a168feb3f9b0b64a78603d7e42d0872af5fa8cf5663f1c12d1dd18",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "没有人能灭了中国！",
      "output_sha256": "b0d13a761cb8981f8f1d726d4425bbda413a9babd64cdf86635c5fcf48358d79",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "b0d13a761cb8981f8f1d726d4425bbda413a9babd64cdf86635c5fcf48358d79",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "关于朋友们，他对于我所关切的只提到两三位。",
      "output_sha256": "f733c2130c9f6827cb7e7009e13b4f5d2d37148005ec060da88dae547b25d52f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "f733c2130c9f6827cb7e7009e13b4f5d2d37148005ec060da88dae547b25d52f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有一位，他说，因为责任的关系不肯轻易离平，可是生计大成问题：假若老得不到外间的接济，他纵使忠于职守，可是没法避免饥寒。",
      "output_sha256": "35e540a30841d34f35d8fab0e4459131b5748441e657a70af95ca71ddbde0077",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "35e540a30841d34f35d8fab0e4459131b5748441e657a70af95ca71ddbde0077",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "另一位有个音韵学专家，现在正领着几个学生埋首著作，大概在数月之中，能至少写出四五本书来。",
      "output_sha256": "a208b53a2d72376a569c8a309f77ae1a5b471a009e1ee890ca76cd88b77f99a4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "a208b53a2d72376a569c8a309f77ae1a5b471a009e1ee890ca76cd88b77f99a4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是他自己与学生们都须吃饭，而外间的援助至今还没有一点可靠的消息。",
      "output_sha256": "37fa5b33a8c432387786f71591e4db0908e721f9fadbbe55a546b4d631a3664c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "37fa5b33a8c432387786f71591e4db0908e721f9fadbbe55a546b4d631a3664c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第三位是颇有干才的人，理应出来作些组织民众的事务，但是他既顾虑家庭的安全，又不知道外间的情形；最讨厌的还是连路费也找不出来。",
      "output_sha256": "cf807c6021e8adb4e7f81068801389f7eb86cb740b80ffb0888e8530ffd64012",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "cf807c6021e8adb4e7f81068801389f7eb86cb740b80ffb0888e8530ffd64012",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "以这三位为例，其他朋友的情形大概与此大同小异。",
      "output_sha256": "6dff15772ccffc1bfcf559a60197b120058093cb767c886831c66be428a0a6fa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "6dff15772ccffc1bfcf559a60197b120058093cb767c886831c66be428a0a6fa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我认为大家应该各自联系认识的朋友，急忙给予帮助，促使他们尽快做些他们能做的事情，否则总是困在原地，损失实在太大。",
      "output_sha256": "1d578730265f09c656256f8060224890f8fb24cc9e8e0a7be4f28f4f08e38ac5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.47462,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3aa49451517ad9e4d40041084e5bdbd86bf84ed89cd1924d768c68c1967bb595"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1d578730265f09c656256f8060224890f8fb24cc9e8e0a7be4f28f4f08e38ac5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "关于周君自己，他说走到天津曾经被扣留。",
      "output_sha256": "c4d119f0d0274f935d837744f2e1873cbe665fa879bbe592aad6058af4b35155",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "c4d119f0d0274f935d837744f2e1873cbe665fa879bbe592aad6058af4b35155",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "据他看，敌军的兵士的扣留旅客似乎并无标准，而只是必须扣留几个，以便塞责。",
      "output_sha256": "98f04de8785f9807364c740f8075f17c5d15eea2c84025f3a2dd1ac51dc46d3f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "98f04de8785f9807364c740f8075f17c5d15eea2c84025f3a2dd1ac51dc46d3f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他被扣后还没经过宪兵审问，就被释放了。",
      "output_sha256": "ae297db5533b560ba18f4c5af8d784d4a15006033d148d5cd0511247de6e5b07",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.737911,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2cfa75a2f528dfdea5bc0ab698861f20cbbd738c1f7577ac7be9eab248fadad3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ae297db5533b560ba18f4c5af8d784d4a15006033d148d5cd0511247de6e5b07",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，周君刚走，我便听说好友赵水澄在经过天津时遭到毒打的消息。",
      "output_sha256": "d8d4dc9ad6cadab9bb906a26522cc3c25adc61351ef153b7e991218f0a49cdb6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.64458,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "090cdea1b198fb889e982b2f8b679f621ea09dc51d1426a45b062af86e047e0b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d8d4dc9ad6cadab9bb906a26522cc3c25adc61351ef153b7e991218f0a49cdb6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我不知道水澄是哪一天路过济南的，也不清楚这个消息的真实性。",
      "output_sha256": "a7f6042efd3f450b952b4a462fa89c0adafde1819ef0de94a2fe5e245140dce7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.670433,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7bea54d434b31d3874f9f2be520b33ed5961ab8955f950fdb1e712e7c2f90803"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a7f6042efd3f450b952b4a462fa89c0adafde1819ef0de94a2fe5e245140dce7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如果周君的观察属实，那就证明敌军士兵并不热衷于此事，因为他们心里明白这是毫无意义的——其中的好处完全是上级军官的。",
      "output_sha256": "37099c93d060093cd48d918fe9b0e5e314611c5a2ced18bed01418400aff1b63",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.542969,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3c87ca29f1c6bb0d7e741caa257120e33a4b9c9a61418ca04fac1154fdd93079"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "37099c93d060093cd48d918fe9b0e5e314611c5a2ced18bed01418400aff1b63",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "另一方面，假若水澄遭毒打的消息属实，那么以前听到的学生失踪，以及敌人种种残暴的兽性的行为，便正如到处轰炸平民一样的确实。",
      "output_sha256": "9be239adf4ca6824d68215dd0b25f1456643ecffe5e5702ddd74485515b297c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "9be239adf4ca6824d68215dd0b25f1456643ecffe5e5702ddd74485515b297c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们只能拚命了，别等着被人家捆起来收拾，且在手脚还自由的时候先扑奔敌人的喉头去！",
      "output_sha256": "0cc294ad447b353c03f8ade7b2aa5004527223d56d31944c5a43acde1c37a3b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "0cc294ad447b353c03f8ade7b2aa5004527223d56d31944c5a43acde1c37a3b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“丧失了生命便能得到生命”，关键在于你敢不敢首先冲过去！",
      "output_sha256": "53631a4c7bc187b5ececb34c6f37c1457a6214eb28c03da01bab97abed7ad189",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": 0.581757,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b2fdd891fdbef4219506c7bbaa2b46a198e5bd3f840ee0806298fe0cae3a0c28"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_ai_sha256": "53631a4c7bc187b5ececb34c6f37c1457a6214eb28c03da01bab97abed7ad189",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ]
    }
  ]
}
